    "sections": {
        "description": "Visa Consulting Service is designed for agencies and professionals who provide immigration, travel documentation, and legal consulting services. This theme includes clean page layouts, service sections, consultation forms, appointment booking integration, testimonials, and contact pages to help present visa services in a clear and organized way. It also supports responsive design, SEO-friendly structure, fast loading performance, and easy customization options. This theme can be used by visa consultants, immigration consultants, travel agencies, overseas education consultants, legal advisors, and documentation service providers who want to create a professional online presence and share information about visa processes, documentation requirements, and consultation services. Built with modern design standards, it supports service pages, blog sections, contact forms, and business information pages, making it suitable for service-based websites focused on immigration services, travel consulting, and business consulting services. Demo: https://demos.buywptemplates.com/visa-consulting-service-pro/"
    },
